@base = http://127.0.0.1:8088/api
@buyerToken = REPLACE_WITH_BUYER_JWT
@sellerToken = REPLACE_WITH_SELLER_JWT
@outsiderToken = REPLACE_WITH_THIRD_PARTY_JWT
@sellerUserId = 2
@buyerUserId = 3
@conversationId = REPLACE_WITH_CONVERSATION_ID

### 买家按商品创建或取得会话
POST {{base}}/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": {{sellerUserId}},
  "sourceType": "PRODUCT",
  "sourceId": 1
}

### 卖家重复创建，应返回同一 conversationId
POST {{base}}/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": {{buyerUserId}},
  "sourceType": "PRODUCT",
  "sourceId": 1
}

### 当前用户会话列表
GET {{base}}/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 买家发送消息
POST {{base}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "UC24 demo message"
}

### 卖家读取历史并把收到的消息标为已读
GET {{base}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 第三方读取，应返回业务码 403
GET {{base}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}

### 第三方发送，应返回业务码 403
POST {{base}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "must be rejected"
}

### 买家拉黑卖家，之后双方均不能向该会话发送
POST {{base}}/report-block/block
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": {{sellerUserId}}
}

### 清理演示拉黑关系
DELETE {{base}}/report-block/block/{{sellerUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
